      "preview": "SUPPLY TERMINAL\nCASH $∞\nSUPPLIES\nBUILDS\n\nPick up MedPens and field intel. Night 1: each Shambler is worth 1 skull value before bonuses. Bank skulls at the HQ window: 1 skull value = 1 Cash.\n\nFIELD INTEL\nSee every enemy type, count and approach at the HQ panel.\nBuy — 120 Cash\n+\nMEDPEN0 / 3 CARRIED\nAuto-injector. H to jab one: heals 60% of max health. Natural regen only ever climbs back to 40%.\n$35\nBACK TO THE FIGHT (E / ESC)",
